	MEMORIES/GPUI canvas elements need explicit size_full even inside a flex-filling parent = Project lesson from the missing-scene GPUI adapter defect and two-layer visual verification.
	MEMORIES/GPUI's simple image painter does not expose sprite-atlas source cropping = Adapter limitation and production-ready sprite rendering options
	MEMORIES/Guest-declared audio can remain application-agnostic and decimal-fixed through the PCM boundary = Durable design lesson for opaque guest synth programs, integer DSP, and one-way PCM conversion
	MEMORIES/Live WAT reloads need transactional candidate swap and explicit state schema = Project lesson from content-watched transactional hot reload and real-window verification
	MEMORIES/Long headless simulations must divide Wasmtime work into refueled calls = Why deterministic headless simulation slices guest ticks across fresh Wasmtime fuel budgets
	MEMORIES/Port per-second browser physics to fixed ticks by converting dimensions exactly once = Dimensional-analysis lesson for velocity, acceleration, rotation, and strict time thresholds in 60-Hz fixed simulation
