	PROJECT_OVERVIEW.md = Project purpose, terminology, and success definition
	README.md = Public concept, architecture, live-reload demonstration, controls, status, and limitations
	RULES.md = Non-negotiable architecture, containment, determinism, and workflow constraints
	SPEC.md = Proof-of-concept goals, generic ABI contract, bounds, deterministic state/audio, security, testing, and implementation status
