	build = Top-level optimized Nix build and debug/test dispatcher
	docs/I18N.md = Prepare-phase localization boundary and canonical future locale policy
	flake.nix = Reproducible Rust build, checks, development tools, and Linux GPUI libraries
	plugins/vibesteroids.wat = Schema-3 decimal-fixed Vibesteroids game, rendering, controls, synth declarations, and source-derived mechanics
	run = Optimized local GUI launch inside the Nix development environment
	src/bin/gpui-wasm-render.rs = Headless CLI that advances bundled or external WAT in fuel-safe slices and emits deterministic SVG
	src/lib.rs = GPUI-independent Wasmtime runtime, bounded host ABI, launch resolution, synth metadata, snapshots, reload, and SVG core
	src/main.rs = Native full-window GPUI adapter with decimal-fixed synth, viewport/input/menu mapping, deterministic seed, and live reload
	test = Full deterministic headless tests plus GUI compilation check
	tests/composition.rs = Independent affine path, image, animated sprite, resource-budget, and stack-balance fixture
	tests/containment.rs = Hostile-WAT import, fuel, number, lifecycle, and budget containment checks
	tests/fixed_decimal.rs = Boundary and regression tests proving schema-3 integer-only simulation, resize translation, and fixed-decimal audio
	tests/frontplane.rs = Independent headless behavioral suite for Vibesteroids state, fixed physics, rendering, controls, lifecycle, and fidelity boundaries
	tests/gui_cli.rs = Native GUI runner help/about/error CLI contract tests without opening a window
	tests/hot_reload.rs = Transactional candidate swap, compatible state transfer, schema restart, and rollback coverage
	tests/launch.rs = Pure CLI source/watch/seed resolution and file-revision coalescing tests
	tests/render_cli.rs = CLI coverage for frame differences, spaced paths, help/about, and invalid options.
	tests/svg_export.rs = Pure SVG artifact coverage plus deterministic Vibesteroids frame progression.
	tests/synth.rs = Guest-declared synth ABI, exact descriptor capture, and set-based invalid-field classifier tests
	third_party/ztracing = Apache-2.0 no-op compatibility surface replacing GPUI's unused GPL tracing path
